		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Stout, grey dragon-kin with two legs and wings. Scales are natural camouflage. spit balls of solid fog.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +2 (1d8) or 1 fog gout, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Camouflage</strong>. Hard to see, ADV to sneak and hide.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fog Gout</strong>. Gout explosive ball of solid fog within double near. All creatures in a near- sized cube around where the blast lands, DEX 12+ or 1d6 damage and knocked prone. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mistblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
